配置文件/依赖缺失，无法完全确定，但进程退出是导致 `CrashLoopBackOff` 的直接原因。\n- 证据 1、2 证明了应用反复退出并被 Kubelet 判定为崩溃循环。\n- 证据 3 和 4 证明了进程是在 HTTP 请求处理周期中因“运行时退出”而终止的。\n\n**缺失的决定性事实：**\n由于当前收集不到上一次崩溃容器的具体堆栈日志（如 `ep4-previous-logs` 工具尝试缺失或失败），无法精准定位触发 Exit Code 2 的具体应用层代码或配置细节。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 37.0s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 52.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c: 52.8s (Evidence 41.6s, RCA 10.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 12.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c**: pod-crashloop-runtime, pod-oomkilled\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 102.626, "metrics": {"run_id": "e9a2897828de489e", "mttr": {"value": "1.7m", "seconds": 102.63356924057007, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-oomkilled, pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence,